Join 2-20 video clips end to end into one video file, in the order given, with hard cuts or crossfades.

CREDIT MODE: Runway account availability is checked against the currently connected workspace.

WHEN TO USE:
- The user generated several clips (e.g. multiple `generate_video` shots of a story) and wants them as one video: "put these together", "combine the clips", "make it one video", "join them into a 30s ad".
- The user has their own clips and wants them assembled in a specific order.

WHEN NOT TO USE:
- To generate a new multi-scene video from a story → `generate_multishot_video`.
- To make one clip longer by generating more footage → `expand_video` / `generate_video`.
